    "additionalInformation": "<p></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Kia Ora Adventure Horse\r\nTrekker,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-NZ\"></span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto;\">Thank you for choosing to ride with us on the\r\nbeautiful, Glen Lyon Station Pack Trail we are so looking forward to meeting\r\nyou.&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto;\">Now is the time to be looking at flights if you\r\nneed them. </span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto;\">Important\r\nInformation</span></b><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto;\">&nbsp;\r\n</span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto;\">Taxi Pick up in Queenstown begins at <b>11am</b></span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto;\">You will be returned to Queenstown by <b>1:30pm</b> on the day of your departure</span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:6.75pt;line-height:13.5pt\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Helvetica, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;\">Due to heavy traffic in Queenstown we only have 2\r\nlocations that we now pick up from.</span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:6.75pt;mso-add-space:auto;\r\ntext-indent:-18.0pt;line-height:13.5pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Helvetica, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;\">1.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Helvetica, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;\">Outside the Station Building on the corner of\r\nShotover and Camp Streets in central Queenstown&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:6.75pt;text-indent:36.0pt;line-height:\r\n13.5pt\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Helvetica, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;\">or</span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:6.75pt;mso-add-space:auto;\r\ntext-indent:-18.0pt;line-height:13.5pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Helvetica, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;\">2.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Helvetica, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;\">Queenstown airport</span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:6.75pt;line-height:13.5pt\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Helvetica, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;\">Please be at your location at least <b>10 mins</b> prior to pick up.</span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:6.75pt;line-height:13.5pt\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Helvetica, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;\">Tiki Touring </span></b></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:6.75pt;line-height:13.5pt\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Helvetica, &quot;sans-serif&quot;;\">If you are touring New Zealands’ South Island in a\r\ncar then our driver maybe able to pick you up in Cromwell and Omarama as he\r\ntravels through to&nbsp;Glen Lyon Station&nbsp;(this is by prior arrangement\r\nonly)</span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto;\">Don't forget to book house sitters, travel\r\ninsurance and booking your leave if necessary. Even though it may be a long way\r\noff, think about the clothes you will bring, merinos, thermals, togs,\r\nwaterproof trousers and jacket. Use your, \"</span><i><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Roboto;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;color:#2B3C4E;mso-fareast-language:EN-NZ\">Adventure\r\nReady packing list</span></i><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto;\">\" to keep you on track.</span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto;\">Talking Travel\r\nInsurance</span></b></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto;\">This is the time to book your travel insurance.</span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto;\">Customs Can be\r\nStrict in NZ</span></b></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto;\">Please check New Zealands’&nbsp;</span><a rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.customs.govt.nz/personal/prohibited-and-restricted-items/\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto;\">Customs\r\nrestrictions</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto;\">&nbsp;to ensure you understand their\r\nrequirements.</span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto;\">Rider Safety\r\nReading </span></b></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto;\">Even if you are a seasoned rider, we recommend that\r\nyou read through our \"</span><a rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"http://adventurehorsetrekking.co.nz/information/safety-when-riding\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto;\">safety\r\nwhen riding</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto;\">\" information on our web site.</span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto;\">This is a pack trail therefore we will be utilising\r\nthe blue bags</span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto;\">Please don't forget to return the customer\r\ninformation form attached to </span><a rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"mailto:adventurehorsetrekkingnz@farmside.co.nz\"><span style=\"font-size:\r\n12.0pt;font-family:Roboto;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-NZ\">adventurehorsetrekkingnz@farmside.co.nz</span></a><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:Roboto;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:\r\nEN-NZ\"></span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\r\nRoboto;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-language:EN-NZ\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto;\">Enjoy the fun of&nbsp;planning your journey and see\r\nyou soon!</span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:\r\nnormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Roboto;\">Angie John and the Horses</span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:\r\nnormal\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p>&nbsp;</p><br><p></p>",
